# W19, a (k10): stands in its lobby among 35 fake presence senders: it draws the nearest 30 (the client's cap, the
# relay's World:HubFigures 30), never more. The fakes walk (their x is their tick modulo 500), so the nearest 30 change
# all the time; a figure fading out after its GONE beside its successor fading in is shown for a moment (`ghosts`
# counted 31 in the trial merge and 35 at once in round r2b), so the cap is checked on the figures that stay
# (`figures`, without the ones fading out), at exactly 30.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until figures>=30,frames>=600 fail figures>=31
log 30 figures
idle until frames>=3600 fail figures>=31
log never more than 30
